{"sha": "4e33e57ee28c8e9ab6f2cb3617836af3131cb79635fe195a560051f4ac5319e1", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:exp} 章 --- 指数与对数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:1}", "$\\dfrac{\\eu^{3x}\\,\\eu^{-x+1}}{\\eu^{x}} = \\eu^{3x - x + 1 - x} = \\eu^{x+1}$.", "", "$\\ln\\!\\left(\\dfrac{\\eu^2\\sqrt{\\eu}}{\\eu^{-3}}\\right)", "= 2 + \\tfrac12 + 3 = \\tfrac{11}{2}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:2}", "\\emph{(a)} 设 $X = \\eu^x > 0$，由 $X^2 - 3X + 2 = 0$ 得", "$X = 1$ 或 $X = 2$，两者均为正，故 $x = 0$ 或 $x = \\ln 2$。", "", "\\emph{(b)} 定义域为 $x - 1 > 0$ 且 $x + 2 > 0$，故 $x > 1$。方程", "化为 $\\ln\\bigl((x-1)(x+2)\\bigr) = \\ln 4$，于是 $(x-1)(x+2) = 4$，", "\\emph{即} $x^2 + x - 6 = 0$，故 $x = 2$ 或 $x = -3$。仅 $x = 2$ 属于", "定义域，因此 $S = \\{2\\}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:3}", "两边除以 $\\eu^x$：", "$\\dfrac{1 - x^2\\eu^{-x}}{1 + \\eu^{-x}} \\to \\dfrac{1-0}{1+0} = 1$，利用", "$x^2 \\eu^{-x} \\to 0$（见\\cref{thm:g12:exp:growth}）。", "", "$\\dfrac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt x} \\to 0$，由\\cref{prop:g12:exp:lnanalytic}（", "$n = 2$ 的情形）。", "", "$x^2 \\ln x = x \\cdot (x \\ln x) \\to 0 \\times 0 = 0$.", "", "$x - \\ln x = x\\left(1 - \\frac{\\ln x}{x}\\right) \\to +\\infty$，因为", "$\\frac{\\ln x}{x} \\to 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:4}", "$f'(x) = \\eu^{-x} - x\\eu^{-x} = (1 - x)\\eu^{-x}$，其符号与 $1 - x$ 一致：", "$f$ 在 $\\intoc{-\\infty}{1}$ 上递增，在 $\\intco{1}{+\\infty}$ 上递减，", "从而有全局最大值 $f(1) = \\eu^{-1}$。", "", "极限：当 $x \\to +\\infty$ 时，$f(x) = \\frac{x}{\\eu^x} \\to 0$", "（见\\cref{thm:g12:exp:growth}）；当 $x \\to -\\infty$ 时，$x \\to -\\infty$ 且", "$\\eu^{-x} \\to +\\infty$，故 $f(x) \\to -\\infty$。", "", "$f''(x) = -\\eu^{-x} - (1-x)\\eu^{-x} = (x - 2)\\eu^{-x}$，它在", "$x = 2$ 处变号，拐点为 $\\bigl(2,\\, 2\\eu^{-2}\\bigr)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:5}", "设 $g(x) = x - \\ln(1+x)$，定义在 $\\intoo{-1}{+\\infty}$ 上。则", "$g'(x) = 1 - \\frac{1}{1+x} = \\frac{x}{1+x}$，在 $\\intoo{-1}{0}$ 上为负，且", "在 $\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 上为正：$g$ 取得最小值 $g(0) = 0$，", "从而 $g \\geq 0$，且等号仅在 $0$ 处成立。因此 $\\ln(1+x) \\leq x$。", "", "取 $x = \\frac1n$：", "$n\\ln\\left(1 + \\frac1n\\right) \\leq 1$，于是", "$\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)^n = \\eu^{\\,n\\ln(1+1/n)} \\leq \\eu$.", "再取 $x = -\\frac{1}{n+1} > -1$：", "$\\ln\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{n+1}\\right) \\leq -\\frac{1}{n+1}$，于是", "$-(n+1)\\ln\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{n+1}\\right) \\geq 1$，从而", "$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{n+1}\\right)^{-(n+1)} \\geq \\eu$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:6}", "\\emph{1.} 每年本金乘以 $1.03$：$C_n = C_0 (1.03)^n$。", "", "\\emph{2.} $C_n \\geq 2C_0 \\iff (1.03)^n \\geq 2 \\iff n \\ln 1.03 \\geq \\ln 2", "\\iff n \\geq \\frac{\\ln 2}{\\ln 1.03} \\approx 23.45$：本金在", "$24$ 年后翻倍。", "", "\\emph{3.} $\\frac{70}{3} \\approx 23.3$，与精确值", "$\\frac{\\ln 2}{\\ln 1.03}$。该法则成立的原因是", "$\\ln(1 + r) \\approx r$（$r$ 较小时），故", "$\\frac{\\ln 2}{\\ln(1+r)} \\approx \\frac{0.693}{r} \\approx \\frac{70}{100r}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:7}", "$\\eu^{2x} > \\eu^{x+1} \\iff 2x > x + 1 \\iff x > 1$（指数函数", "严格递增）：$S = \\intoo{1}{+\\infty}$。", "", "第二个不等式的定义域为 $x^2 - 1 > 0$ 且 $x + 5 > 0$，\\emph{即}", "$x \\in \\intoo{-5}{-1} \\cup \\intoo{1}{+\\infty}$。在此定义域上，$\\ln$", "严格递增，于是", "\\[", "\\ln(x^2-1) \\leq \\ln(x+5) \\iff x^2 - 1 \\leq x + 5 \\iff x^2 - x - 6 \\leq 0", "\\iff x \\in \\intcc{-2}{3}.", "\\]", "与定义域取交集，得 $S = \\intco{-2}{-1} \\cup \\intoc{1}{3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:8}", "\\emph{1.} $f'(x) = \\dfrac{\\eu^x x - \\eu^x}{x^2} = \\dfrac{(x-1)\\eu^x}{x^2}$，", "在 $\\intoo{0}{1}$ 上为负，在 $\\intoo{1}{+\\infty}$ 上为正，故有最小值", "$f(1) = \\eu$。极限：$f \\to +\\infty$ 于 $0^+$ 处（分子 $\\to 1$，", "分母 $\\to 0^+$），在 $+\\infty$ 处亦然（见\\cref{thm:g12:exp:growth}）。", "", "\\emph{2.} 当 $x > 0$ 时，$\\eu^x = kx \\iff f(x) = k$。由变化表", "（$+\\infty \\searrow \\eu \\nearrow +\\infty$，两侧各自连续且严格单调）可知：", "$k < \\eu$ 时无解；恰有一解 $x = 1$，此时 $k = \\eu$；", "$k > \\eu$ 时恰有两解（一解在 $\\intoo{0}{1}$ 中，", "另一解在 $\\intoo{1}{+\\infty}$ 中，由每个区间上的双射定理得）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:exp:9}", "\\emph{1.} 由\\cref{exo:g12:exp:5}中的第一个不等式直接可得：", "$u_n = \\eu^{\\,n\\ln(1+1/n)} \\leq \\eu^1 = \\eu$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 写作", "\\[", "\\ln u_n = n \\ln\\!\\left(1 + \\frac1n\\right)", "= \\frac{\\ln\\!\\left(1 + \\frac1n\\right) - \\ln 1}{\\frac1n},", "\\]", "这是 $\\ln$ 在点 $1$ 处的差商，其增量为", "$h = \\frac1n \\to 0$。因 $\\ln$ 在 $1$ 处可导，且导数为", "$1$，$\\ln u_n \\to 1$。由 $\\exp$ 的连续性", "（见\\cref{prop:g12:limcont:seqcont}），$u_n = \\eu^{\\ln u_n} \\to \\eu^1 = \\eu$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}